					"content": "我很好奇，您…您具体是怎么做这道菜的？食材投入了多少？调料是怎么放的？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710981503,
						710981504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加尔恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 710981503,
					"content": "别、别靠这么近！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710981505
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710981505,
					"content": "啊…抱歉，但还是请您详细和我说一说吧，您做菜的手法，说不定能给我一些灵感呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710981506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加尔恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 710981506,
					"content": "旅行者详细讲述了自己烹饪萝卜时蔬汤的手法…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710981507
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710981507,
					"content": "原来如此…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710981508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加尔恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 710981508,
					"content": "唉，一道菜的味道，实在是被太多的变量影响，想要精细计算的话，就必须要投入更多的计算量。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710981509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加尔恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 710981509,
					"content": "但是，更多的计算量，就意味着我必须改良我的「推数机」…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710981510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加尔恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 710981510,
					"content": "希望教令院图书馆里的资料会给我灵感。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710981511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加尔恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 710981511,
					"content": "你为什么要制造「推数机」？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710981512
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710981512,
					"content": "唔，这是一个好问题，但在我回答这个问题之前，我得先问您一个问题。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710981513
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加尔恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 710981513,
					"content": "您觉得，我制造的这台「推数机」是否拥有「思想」？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710981514,
						710981515
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加尔恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 710981514,
					"content": "这问题是什么意思？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710981516
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710981516,
					"content": "没错，请您先想想这个问题吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710981517
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加尔恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 710981517,
					"content": "等我们下次相遇的时候，我们可以就这个问题好好讨论一下。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710981518
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加尔恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 710981518,
					"content": "至于现在嘛，我得先去整理一下数据了…路通，来吧，开始工作了！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710981519
					],
					"speakerTitle": "加尔恰"
				},
				{
					"id": 710981519,
					"content": "是，先生。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710981520
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 710981520,
					"content": "请您收下这些，旅行者。加尔恰先生就是这样，还请您多多包涵。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710981521
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 710981521,
					"content": "你们要去须弥吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710981522
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710981522,
					"content": "是的，加尔恰先生要去教令院查阅资料，而我被他雇佣随行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710981523
					],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 710981523,
					"content": "再见，旅行者。如果我们能在须弥再会，我会很高兴的…我想加尔恰先生也是。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "路通"
				},
				{
					"id": 710981515,
					"content": "「推数机」…是否有「思想」？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710981516
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710981504,
					"content": "你、你先离远点！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710981505
					]
				}
			]
		}
	]
